Drop real images here, then point a CONTENT.IMAGES entry's `src` at them.

Write the path WITHOUT a leading slash:

    src: 'img/gamehouse-hero.png'      correct
    src: '/img/gamehouse-hero.png'     breaks in a subfolder deploy

Files in this folder are committed to git and copied into dist/ verbatim.
Filenames are case-sensitive once deployed, even though macOS is not.

Testimonial avatars — save each person's photo under their own name:

    img/testimonial-emmi-kuusikko.jpg
    img/testimonial-lea-schonfelder.jpg
    img/testimonial-alex-segura.jpg

Square crops look best. Until a file exists the avatar shows the person's
initials rather than a broken image.
